{"id":2145,"name":"小炒黄牛肉","image":"/images/dishes/htc-2145.jpg","category":"荤菜","taste":"咸鲜","cookingMethod":"炒制","difficulty":"复杂","cookingTime":"60分钟","servings":"每份：","ingredients":["牛里脊","芹菜","小米椒","野山椒","香菜"],"preparation":["牛里脊 400g","芹菜 200g","小米椒 30g","野山椒 30g","香菜 30g","食用油 15ml","酱油 6ml"],"steps":["牛里脊切成不超过 3cm 宽，3mm 厚的薄片，倒入 6ml 酱油，用手抓匀备用","芹菜切成不超过 5cm 的小段，备用","小米椒切成丝状，备用","野山椒切成颗粒，备用","香菜切成成不超过 3cm 的小段，备用","热锅，锅内放入 15ml 食用油，大火等待 30 秒让油温升高","放入小米椒和野山椒爆香","放入牛里脊和芹菜，然后大火翻炒 1 分钟","关火，撒上香菜，盛盘"],"nutrition":{"calories":"619 大卡"},"videoTutorials":{"platforms":[{"key":"bilibili","name":"哔哩哔哩","searchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E5%B0%8F%E7%82%92%E9%BB%84%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"},{"key":"douyin","name":"抖音","searchUrl":"https://www.douyin.com/search/%E5%B0%8F%E7%82%92%E9%BB%84%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B?type=video"}]},"source":{"name":"HowToCook","repository":"Anduin2017/HowToCook","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/c694a5c457d45e6e012ae6cd9a7724aab86e320b/dishes/meat_dish/%E5%B0%8F%E7%82%92%E9%BB%84%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89/%E5%B0%8F%E7%82%92%E9%BB%84%E7%89%9B%E8%82%89.md"}}
